01:05:20.337 --> 01:05:21.670
I said, I don't want to do that.

01:05:21.670 --> 01:05:25.090
To me, it's an enormous,
enormous evolutionary event,

01:05:25.090 --> 01:05:27.327
incredibly big
evolutionary event,

01:05:27.327 --> 01:05:29.410
